                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 18pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.46in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为了研究新课程、新课标、新教材和新课堂，助力教师</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">专业化发展</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5月23-24日，以“深度学习视域下单元整体教学的设计与实施”为主题的绍兴市高中英语新课程新教材研讨活动在我校成功举办。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.46in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2023/5/202305251659097887.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202305251659097887.jpg" /></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">此次活动以</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人教社新教材选择性必修2第5单元</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><em>Poems</em></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的教学展开</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。23日下午，鲁迅中学的朱小敏老师、新昌中学的王巍老师和绍兴市第一中学的陈伊伊老师分别围绕</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">主题单元整体教学的实践与思考</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">做了主题报告，春晖中学的李浩老师和诸暨中学的张立峰老师分别围绕</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">指向真实学习体验的语言课堂实践</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">做了主题报告。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">朱小敏老师从概念</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">及其</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">重要性入手，指出基于主题意义的单元整体教学实践的必要性，并通过课例分享明确具体操作方法，即</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">确定单元教学指导思想，研读单元内容，探究关联，提炼大小观念，设计单元整体教学目标和课时目标，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">并</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">基于课时目标合理设计教学评一体化活动。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2023\5\202305251658303718.Jpeg" style="width: 5.756945in; height: 4.315278in" alt="202305251658309407.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王巍老师围绕</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">基于单元主题意义探究的英语听说语篇教学实践</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">做了分享。他指出，听说语篇教学应该深入研读文本，挖掘单元主题意义，从</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教学目标确立</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教学情境设置</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教学活动设计</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等方面科学地整合听前、听中、听后环节，引导学生感知主题意义，培养思维品质，提升核心素养。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2023\5\202305251658301229.Jpeg" style="width: 5.734722in; height: 3.831944in" alt="202305251658304163.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">陈伊伊老师提出了</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">基于大问题的单元整体教学探索</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">这一新模式，详细解读了其内涵、理论依据以及教学思路，并结合选择性必修三第五单元Poems这一单元课例</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">阐明了具体实践路径，获得了</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">与</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">会专家和老师们的一致好评。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2023\5\202305251658302452.Jpeg" style="width: 5.768055in; height: 3.525694in" alt="202305251658300835.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">李浩老师从深度学习的研究历史、概念界定、特征意义和实施策略等方面</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">阐述了基于深度学习的课堂教学策略实施，并结合一堂基于“产出导向法”的课堂教学实例</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">来</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">示范践行</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">深度学习理念。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2023\5\202305251658307969.Jpeg" style="width: 5.768055in; height: 4.325695in" alt="202305251658307651.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">张立峰老师从体验式视角切入，结合自己的具体课堂教学实例，分享了以“共情，共学，共创，共赏”为题的教学尝试与反思。他以“引—教—学—思—用—评”为主线，记录和分享学生上课产出实况，深度还原了课堂教学中“阅读——内化——表达”的</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学习活动</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">三部曲。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2023\5\202305251658309505.Jpeg" style="width: 5.768055in; height: 4.325695in" alt="202305251658306358.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">24日上午为课堂观摩</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">嵊州中学的蔡马英老师、杭二中钱江学校的马瑾辰老师以及我校盛婷婷老师</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">分别就</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教材指定篇章</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">开设了听说综合课、阅读与思维课以及读写结合课。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">第一节课由蔡马英老师执教，课型为听说综合课。蔡马英老师结合视听说多模态学习理论、自主学习能力培养以及大单元教学理念，帮助学生尝试英文诗歌创作，突出了听说板块在单元内容中的衔接作用。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2023\5\202305251658307488.Jpeg" style="width: 5.725in; height: 4.29375in" alt="202305251658307530.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">第二节课由马瑾辰老师执教，课型为阅读与思维课。马瑾辰老师以英语学习活动观为指导，设计了不同层次的活动，创</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">设</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生与教师、学生与学生、学与教的学习共同体。通过感知理解、应用实际、创造迁移，引导学生体验诗歌的意义与价值，以“活”的方法和过程，实现了师生之间、生生之间高度融合、互相激活的课堂。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2023\5\202305251658308594.Jpeg" style="width: 5.730556in; height: 3.327778in" alt="202305251658305497.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">第三节课由我校盛婷婷老师执教，类型为读写结合课。盛婷婷老师通过童谣歌曲和教师自身照片引入，让学生了解童谣的魅力，唤起学生积极性；</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">随后</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">通过邀请学生朗读话题诗歌《梦想》并分享看法，引导学生感悟诗歌韵律美和意蕴美</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生通过小组讨论和口头赏析，梳理并内化诗歌赏析的要素，实现思想感情上的升华；输出环节教师以思维导图的形式复现诗歌赏析的各要素，帮助学生完成从输入到输出的转化，实现知识的迁移创新。盛婷婷老师以创新的教学设计、扎实的教学基本功以及生动形象的教学展示，充分展示了我校青年教师的风采，赢得了在场专家与老师的一致好评。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2023\5\202305251658312004.Jpeg" style="width: 5.725in; height: 4.29375in" alt="202305251658318796.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">展示课后，绍兴市教育教学研究院的英语教研员戴军熔老师就“深度学习视域下的单元整体教学及真实学习体验：实践与思考”做主题报告。戴老师从单元整体教学的本质及实施路径（本质特性、实施路径、课型设计）和真实学习体验的实践策略两大方面做了精彩生动的报告，给在场老师们带来了很多启发。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2023\5\202305251658317305.Jpeg" style="width: 5.734722in; height: 3.525in" alt="202305251658315678.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.46in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本次教研活动，无论是授课者还是听课者，都受益匪浅。唯有在教研中不断</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">更新</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教育理念，转变教学方式，才能在课改中披荆斩棘，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为绍兴英语教学的进一步发展</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">贡献力量</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.46in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本次教研活动圆满结束，感谢</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各级</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">领导的大力支持和</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">后勤</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">和</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">技术</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">部门</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的周到服务，感谢每一位授课教师辛勤付出，感谢参与班级的大力配合，感谢英语组团队的通力合作。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #191919;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">                         </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p>
    
